  "notes": "Made by an AI agent (Claude Sonnet, Anthropic) in the maintainers' newcomer study on 2026-11-05; the agent chose the player name. The design is the reference mul_tree_h (a carry-save tree of 4:2 compressors with two-row leaves and a ripple-carry final adder) with the same dataflow and generate-block labels; only the Boolean form of the cell assigns changed (XOR association, carries written as muxes, which compressor input arrives late), chosen by a search over those forms scored with score/ppa.py. The proof is the reference proof with one added lemma that restates its arithmetic theorem for these gate forms by a Boolean case split. The header comments of both files are the reference's, unchanged. Proof ported by the maintainers for the 2026-11-06 range change; design unchanged.",
